 and rise to meet their purpose. Below are a list of quick references and resources to help our faculty and staff get the most our their job, both in and out of the office. Academic Calendar Campus Bookstore Campus Directory Campus Fundraising Request Canvas Learning Management System Center for Teaching & Learning Course Catalog C.A.R.E. Referral Form Events News Office of Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Policies & Information Page Sidebar Marketing Request Forms The Office of Marketing and Public Relations is responsible for producing all external engagement for the College. This department creates promotional materials (brochures, posters, advertisements, etc.), produces and publishes (press releases, news stories, feature stories, college magazine), maintain institutional social media channels and website. Please select the Request Form which best describes your job. A completed request form must be on file before Marketing & PR can begin processing your job. Website Update Request Print & Design Request Press Release Request Announcement & Event Calendar Request Business Card Request Photography/Video Request Faculty Development Center for Teaching & Learning The Center for Teaching & Learning (CTL) advances Blackburn College’s educational mission by supporting a community of diverse educators. The CTL promotes professional learning through progressive, evidence-based pedagogy and the development of learner-focused classrooms, hosting regular events, including informal luncheons, professional learning shareouts, and occasional workshops. Visit the CTL Nov 11 Wednesday, November 11, 2026 Veteran’s Day Convocation, 11am Nov 11 - All day Nov 25 Wednesday, November 25, 2026 Thanksgiving Holiday Nov 25 8:00 AM - Nov 27 5:00 PM Dec 14 Monday, December 14, 2026 Final grade rosters due by 1:00 PM Dec 14 - All day Jan 04 Monday, January 04, 2027 Campus Opens from Winter Break Jan 04 - All day Jan 12 Tuesday, January 12, 2027 Work Program training, New Student Orientatio